docs/FPMS_Frontend_Manual_Test_User_Guide.md:378:- `PUT /commission/rules/{id}` -> `200`
docs/FPMS_Frontend_Manual_Test_User_Guide.md:379:- `GET /commission` -> `200`
docs/FPMS_Frontend_Manual_Test_User_Guide.md:380:- `POST /commission/settlements` -> `201/200`
docs/FPMS_Frontend_Manual_Test_User_Guide.md:381:- `POST /commission/settlements/{id}/generate-lines` -> `200`
docs/FPMS_Frontend_Manual_Test_User_Guide.md:382:- `GET /commission/reports/settlement` -> `200`
docs/FPMS_Frontend_Manual_Test_User_Guide.md:384:### 5.12 Consulting（顾问链路）
docs/FPMS_Frontend_Manual_Test_User_Guide.md:388:- `/consulting/cases/new`
docs/FPMS_Frontend_Manual_Test_User_Guide.md:389:- `/consulting/fee-drafts/new`
docs/FPMS_Frontend_Manual_Test_User_Guide.md:390:- `/consulting/profitability`
docs/FPMS_Frontend_Manual_Test_User_Guide.md:393:1) 进入 `/consulting/cases/new`，按项目类型填写必填项并提交。  
docs/FPMS_Frontend_Manual_Test_User_Guide.md:395:3) 进入 `/consulting/fee-drafts/new`，按 `FIXED/HOURLY/HYBRID` 任一模式填写并提交。  
docs/FPMS_Frontend_Manual_Test_User_Guide.md:397:5) 进入 `/consulting/profitability`，输入项目 ID 后查询收益。  
